 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "I Debuted as an Exorcist, Not an Idol"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "아이돌이 아니라 퇴마사로 데뷔해 버렸다"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "A girl competes in an idol survival show and builds a love-hate dynamic with a top star judge. Despite reaching the finals, she fails to debut. Soon after, she discovers that the star can see ghosts and is destined to die—because of her. To save both their futures, she disguises herself as a bodyguard and takes on the mission of exorcising spirits, learning everything from YouTube."
  },
